          <div className="ci-record-detail"><p>{r.passage}</p><div className="ci-source-meta"><span><ShieldCheck size={14} /> Reviewed {r.verified_on}</span><span>Review due {r.review_due_on}</span>{r.trim && <span>{r.trim}</span>}<span>{r.powertrain}</span></div><ul>{r.caveats.map((c) => <li key={c}>{c}</li>)}</ul><a href={r.source_uri} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Read official source <ArrowUpRight size={15} /></a></div>
        </details>) : <div className="ci-empty"><Search size={28} /><h3>No reviewed evidence for this selection.</h3><p>Try another brand, market or search term. No competitor availability is inferred from missing data.</p><button onClick={() => { setQuery(""); setBrand("All brands"); setMarket("All markets"); }}>Explore all references <ArrowUpRight size={15} /></button></div>}</div>
      </section>

      <section className="ci-perspective" aria-labelledby="ci-perspective-heading">
        <div className="ci-perspective-intro"><Fingerprint size={30} /><span className="ci-kicker">THE BMW OPPORTUNITY</span><h2 id="ci-perspective-heading">Beyond feature parity.</h2><p>Turn a competitor signal into a better question. Explore potential benefits and costs before proposing a change.</p><span className="ci-hypothesis-tag"><Sparkles size={13} /> Editorial prompts · not agent output</span></div>
        <div className="ci-lens"><div className="ci-lens-tabs" role="group" aria-label="Opportunity perspective">{lenses.map((l, i) => <button key={l.title} aria-pressed={lens === i} className={lens === i ? "active" : ""} onClick={() => setLens(i)}>{l.title}</button>)}</div><div key={lens} className="ci-lens-content"><h3>{activeLens.question}</h3><div className="ci-effects"><div><span>+ POTENTIAL UPSIDE</span><p>{activeLens.positive}</p></div><div><span>− POTENTIAL TRADE-OFF</span><p>{activeLens.negative}</p></div></div><p className="ci-validation">Hypotheses to validate with customer research, BMW fitment and engineering cost. No impact estimate is asserted.</p></div></div>
      </section>
      <footer className="ci-footer"><ShieldCheck size={15} /><span>Traceable sources. Explicit uncertainty. Better product decisions.</span><span>Independent hackathon research</span></footer>
    </div>
  );
}
