| `public/images/competitors/tesla.svg` | https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/bd/Tesla_Motors.svg | https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Tesla_Motors.svg credits Tesla as author/source; PD-textlogo, trademark restrictions apply |

The competitor page imports the public curated catalog from `backend/evidence/competitors.json`; it does not ship private BMW files or saved runs. Current-reference eligibility is evaluated against the browser's UTC date. Market filters are explicit and missing data has an empty state. Cards are editorial research lenses, not measured rankings. Benefit/trade-off prompts are authored hypotheses, not live Qwen output. The hero reuses the existing attributed Paper Shaders adaptation; reduced motion is respected.
